{"id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-configuration.md","title":"Turing Machine Configuration","display":"df-tm-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-configuration","aliases":["88-df-tm-configuration"],"display":"df-tm-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-tape]]","[[88-df-tm-state]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-configuration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c412569a8bba638b\" href=\"?note=c412569a8bba638b\" title=\"88-df-tm-tape\">88-df-tm-tape</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d38664b9a0dc8443\" href=\"?note=d38664b9a0dc8443\" title=\"88-df-tm-state\">88-df-tm-state</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q \\in Q_M\">\\(q \\in Q_M\\)</span> (current state, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d38664b9a0dc8443\" href=\"?note=d38664b9a0dc8443\" title=\"88-df-tm-state\">88-df-tm-state</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\\)</span> (finite-support tape, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c412569a8bba638b\" href=\"?note=c412569a8bba638b\" title=\"88-df-tm-tape\">88-df-tm-tape</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i \\in \\mathbb{Z}\">\\(i \\in \\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> (head position)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\\)</span> (configuration predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{state}(c),\\operatorname{tape}(c),\\operatorname{head}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{state}(c),\\operatorname{tape}(c),\\operatorname{head}(c)\\)</span> (configuration projections)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}configuration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\exists q\\in Q_M\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(c=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}configuration} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\exists q\\in Q_M\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(c=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Tape}_{\\Gamma_M,B_M}(T)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\nc=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{state}(c)=q\n\\land\\operatorname{tape}(c)=T\n\\land\\operatorname{head}(c)=i\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\nc=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{state}(c)=q\n\\land\\operatorname{tape}(c)=T\n\\land\\operatorname{head}(c)=i\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M(c)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是 Turing 机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的配置</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c = \\langle q,T,i\\rangle\">\\(c = \\langle q,T,i\\rangle\\)</span> : 状态<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、双向无限磁带<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>和读写头位置<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span></li>\n<li>配置完全刻画 Turing 机在某一时刻的状态</li>\n<li>三个投影由有序三元组唯一确定，供运行、停机与输出定义复用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-tape","status":"resolved","id":"c412569a8bba638b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-tape]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-state","status":"resolved","id":"d38664b9a0dc8443","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M \\in \\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing machine, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-state","status":"resolved","id":"d38664b9a0dc8443","anchor":"ref-5","ta